{
    "word": "samovar",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "15577ffe-4520-3902-9cf9-329eb48d5776",
                "word": "samovar",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "86a7df73-20c2-4022-856d-d06f37a9f51b",
                        "entry_id": "15577ffe-4520-3902-9cf9-329eb48d5776",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "samovars"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "d48501e9-53fa-31b6-9ede-d179c0f9ba08",
                        "entry_id": "15577ffe-4520-3902-9cf9-329eb48d5776",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A metal urn with a spigot, for boiling water for making tea. Traditionally, the water is heated by hot coals or charcoal in a chimney-like tube which runs through the center of the urn. Today, it is more likely that the water is heated by an electric coil."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e46e3c8b-7b32-4387-808f-0a1f3e9d9ef6",
                                "sense_id": "d48501e9-53fa-31b6-9ede-d179c0f9ba08",
                                "text": "Come on now with the samovar ─ and make haste sorting the letter-bag."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3a0d4a60-64b5-4577-bd32-b492582ec7de",
                                "sense_id": "d48501e9-53fa-31b6-9ede-d179c0f9ba08",
                                "text": "Eurydice pointed to the cupboard, and sat down on the low divan with folded hands, and looked at the floor.[…]Elsa made her drink a glass of vodka. Then she fetched the samovar from the kitchen, and made tea."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "110b3ad6-e65a-4bbb-9b3b-6ec2049a5af0",
                                "sense_id": "d48501e9-53fa-31b6-9ede-d179c0f9ba08",
                                "text": "“Chumley. The beverage situation around here is reprehensible.” “Oh, good morning, sunshine.” “Surely our massive conglomerate parent company could spring for a samovar of coffee.” “Yeah, or like a big coffee dispenser.” “That's what a samovar is.” “Are there other black nerds, or is it just you and Urkel?”"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a1b8ca15-4a65-416e-afc9-6f765b2d0a99",
                        "source_entry_id": "15577ffe-4520-3902-9cf9-329eb48d5776",
                        "source_sense_id": "d48501e9-53fa-31b6-9ede-d179c0f9ba08",
                        "source_sense_description": "metal urn with a spigot, for boiling water for making tea",
                        "target_lang_word": "samovar",
                        "target_lang_code": "cs",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "9a42486c-757a-4ce6-a56d-10c8febf4827",
                        "source_entry_id": "15577ffe-4520-3902-9cf9-329eb48d5776",
                        "source_sense_id": "d48501e9-53fa-31b6-9ede-d179c0f9ba08",
                        "source_sense_description": "metal urn with a spigot, for boiling water for making tea",
                        "target_lang_word": "samowar",
                        "target_lang_code": "nl",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "samowar",
                                "target_lang_code": "nl",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "167daa65-9249-303f-bd80-5d1ae5d0f361",
                                        "entry_id": "55a60fa8-2da4-3b92-b14d-fa039fa6beeb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "apparaat waarmee men thee kan zetten"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "huishouden"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2386f8c3-23a1-45f5-9fb9-9cead3ea5862",
                                                "sense_id": "167daa65-9249-303f-bd80-5d1ae5d0f361",
                                                "text": "En verdomd: de oven, de samowar – ze werden een eeuw geleden al door Chagall vereeuwigd in tekeningen."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "8205ea6b-fc13-4662-8c78-e811375bda0f",
                        "source_entry_id": "15577ffe-4520-3902-9cf9-329eb48d5776",
                        "source_sense_id": "d48501e9-53fa-31b6-9ede-d179c0f9ba08",
                        "source_sense_description": "metal urn with a spigot, for boiling water for making tea",
                        "target_lang_word": "samovar",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "samovar",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d631fe2d-ad62-311d-995b-e438eb298167",
                                        "entry_id": "e72cf640-fc49-31b8-bc4d-0a975d85d55f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Bouilloire en métal à deux étages, l’étage inférieur contenant de l’eau chaude, l’étage supérieur contenant le thé qui infuse dans un peu d'eau, qui sert à faire le thé."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "adddd6a0-96e5-4f60-98e5-89e27a8ed4e3",
                                                "sense_id": "d631fe2d-ad62-311d-995b-e438eb298167",
                                                "text": "Assez loin d’elle, debout devant une table en véritable laque, une personne grassouillette surveillait le samovar de cuivre où chauffait l’eau qui allait servir à la confection du thé."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "688d69c2-c517-4148-be0f-43e19420c738",
                                                "sense_id": "d631fe2d-ad62-311d-995b-e438eb298167",
                                                "text": "Sans se faire prier, le père Minaï, colosse à barbe d'ébène, ventripotent comme un samovar monstre où bout le sbitène de tout un marché transi de froid, grimpa sur le timonier qui faillit crouler sous son poids."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d7b60e59-6211-4f0c-b9ae-37de4ba46a7e",
                                                "sense_id": "d631fe2d-ad62-311d-995b-e438eb298167",
                                                "text": "Elle avait un énorme samovar : nous prenions cinq ou six verres de thé chacun."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a5b53d33-d480-4bd8-8168-3f3961fe3ad3",
                                                "sense_id": "d631fe2d-ad62-311d-995b-e438eb298167",
                                                "text": "Un adolescent maigre y faisait cuire des galettes sur un feu de bois et entretenait de braises un samovar antique au cuivre terni, bosselé."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5c7db163-404d-4411-9118-e9e8582b39d7",
                                                "sense_id": "d631fe2d-ad62-311d-995b-e438eb298167",
                                                "text": "– Véra est assise en face de mon père de l’autre côté de la table, à la place que doit occuper la maîtresse de maison, derrière le grand samovar de cuivre."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1a463aba-d669-4dce-a36f-2010beea1626",
                                                "sense_id": "d631fe2d-ad62-311d-995b-e438eb298167",
                                                "text": "On but ce soir-là raisonnablement. Les plus pieux se limitaient au thé. À cet effet, un gigantesque samovar circulait, convoyé par trois serviteurs, deux pour le soutenir, un troisième pour servir."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b2730b62-ac95-48c4-aa9e-d6eab7013d54",
                                                "sense_id": "d631fe2d-ad62-311d-995b-e438eb298167",
                                                "text": "Le long des murs courent des paillasses où sont posés samovars, cafetières, bouilloires, plaques chauffantes, mini-fours, presse-fruits et bien d’autres ustensiles."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "b500db0b-1a83-4a2a-955b-f2c9e68cf47b",
                        "source_entry_id": "15577ffe-4520-3902-9cf9-329eb48d5776",
                        "source_sense_id": "d48501e9-53fa-31b6-9ede-d179c0f9ba08",
                        "source_sense_description": "metal urn with a spigot, for boiling water for making tea",
                        "target_lang_word": "Samowar",
